<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>シフト給与計算</title>
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="icon-192.png">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="シフト給与">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f3f6f4" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1a18" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f3f6f4;--surface:#fff;--ink:#16302b;--muted:#5d726c;--line:#d5e0db;--accent:#0f766e;--accent-ink:#fff;--warn:#b4442a;--soft:#e3f0ec;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0f1a18;--surface:#172623;--ink:#e6f1ee;--muted:#93aaa4;--line:#2a3f3b;--accent:#4fd1c0;--accent-ink:#06201c;--warn:#ff9a7e;--soft:#1f3632;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0f1a18;--surface:#172623;--ink:#e6f1ee;--muted:#93aaa4;--line:#2a3f3b;--accent:#4fd1c0;--accent-ink:#06201c;--warn:#ff9a7e;--soft:#1f3632;color-scheme:dark}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Hiragino Sans","Noto Sans JP","Yu Gothic",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}
main{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 48px}
h1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 16px}
h2{font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 12px}
section{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.total{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);border:0}
.total .big{font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.2}
.total .sub{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;font-size:.95rem}
.row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.row>label{flex:1 1 130px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);gap:4px}
input[type=number],input[type=date],input[type=time],input[type=month]{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;width:100%;min-height:42px}
input:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:1px}
.chk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:10px;color:var(--ink)}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;min-height:42px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:700}
button.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--warn);border-color:var(--line);min-height:34px;padding:0 10px;font-weight:500}
.preview{margin:12px 0;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px;font-size:.95rem}
.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.head input{width:auto}
.item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.item:first-of-type{border-top:0}
.item .d{font-weight:700}
.item .t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
.item .p{font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.empty{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:16px 0}
.note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
.dot{display:inline-block;width:.7em;height:.7em;border-radius:50%;margin-right:.4em;box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.85)}
.byjob{margin-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);padding-top:8px}.by{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.88rem;padding:2px 0}
.cj.on{background:var(--c);color:#fff;border-color:var(--c)}
.cd .pl{color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:0 3px;margin-top:1px;max-width:100%;white-space:normal;overflow:hidden;font-weight:600;line-height:1.15;text-align:center}
.cd .pl.sp{background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.3) 0 4px,transparent 4px 8px)}
.jb .row>label{flex:1 1 100px}
.jb{padding:12px 12px 12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:12px}.sw{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.sq:disabled{opacity:.2;cursor:not-allowed}.sq{min-height:32px;width:32px;padding:0;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--line)}.sq.on{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:1px}
.jb input[type=text],select{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;width:100%;min-height:42px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 12px}
.chip{min-height:38px;padding:0 12px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600}
.chip small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;margin-left:6px}.chip.cj.on small{color:inherit;opacity:.85}
.tr{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.92rem}
#who,#tName{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;width:100%;min-height:42px}
.secbar{display:none}
.sechead-b,.fold-h{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;color:inherit!important;padding:0!important;min-height:34px;font-weight:700;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;border-radius:6px}
.sechead{margin:-6px 0 8px}.sechead-b{font-size:1rem}
.sechead-b>span:first-child,.fold-h>span:first-child{margin-right:auto}
.sechead .sm,.fold-h .sm{font-weight:500;font-size:.8rem;opacity:.75;text-align:right;display:none;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:62%}
.chev{flex:0 0 auto;width:1.6em;height:1.6em;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 10%,transparent);font-size:.75rem;transition:transform .15s}
[data-sec]>h2{display:none}
[data-sec].collapsed>*:not(.secbar):not(.sechead){display:none!important}
[data-sec].collapsed{padding:10px 14px}
[data-sec].collapsed .sechead{margin:0}
[data-sec].collapsed .sechead .sm,.fold.closed>.fold-h .sm{display:block}
[data-sec].collapsed .chev,.fold.closed>.fold-h .chev{transform:rotate(-90deg)}
.fold{margin-top:10px}.fold-h{font-size:.9rem}.fold.closed>.fold-b{display:none}
.fold-b{margin-top:4px}
.jb>.fold{margin-top:0}.jb .fold .fold{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:8px}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.chev{transition:none}}
body.edit-layout .secbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:-6px -6px 10px;padding:6px 8px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px}
.secbar b{flex:1;font-size:.88rem}.secbar button{min-height:34px;padding:0 10px}
body.edit-layout [data-sec]{outline:2px dashed var(--line);outline-offset:2px}
body:not(.edit-layout) [data-sec].uhid{display:none!important}
body.edit-layout [data-sec]>*:not(.secbar){display:none!important}body.edit-layout [data-sec]{padding:6px;margin-bottom:8px;display:block!important}body.edit-layout [data-sec] .secbar{margin:0}body.edit-layout .total{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}.secbar button:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:default}body.edit-layout [data-sec].uhid .secbar b{opacity:.5}
body.edit-layout #dayEd{display:none!important}
.cd .pl.tent{background:transparent!important;color:var(--ink);border:1.5px dashed;font-weight:600}.cd.rq{min-height:52px}.cd.rq .rqm{font-size:.62rem}.cd.rq-off{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 22%,var(--bg))!important;border-color:var(--warn)}.cd.rq-ok{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 22%,var(--bg))!important;border-color:var(--accent)}.rqm{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1}.cd.rq-off .rqm{color:var(--warn)}.cd.rq-ok .rqm{color:var(--accent)}.rqo{display:flex;gap:2px;font-size:.55rem}
.cd .wb{position:absolute;top:2px;right:3px;font-size:.62rem;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:var(--warn);border-radius:6px;padding:0 3px;line-height:1.35}.cd{position:relative}
.warnbox{margin:0 0 10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 14%,var(--surface));border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 45%,transparent);font-size:.85rem}
.hero-h{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem}.hero-h small{font-weight:500;opacity:.85}.hnav{background:rgba(255,255,255,.16)!important;border:0!important;color:inherit!important;min-width:38px;min-height:38px;padding:0;font-size:1.3rem;border-radius:50%}
.hero-amt{font-size:3rem!important;text-align:center;margin:6px 0 2px;letter-spacing:.01em}
.hero-sub{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:6px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.95rem;opacity:.95}.hero-sub b{font-size:1.1rem}
.hero-jobs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:4px 14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.82rem;opacity:.9;margin:6px 0 12px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35)}
.ytsum{margin:4px 0 6px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft);text-align:center}.ytbig{font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:2px 0 8px}.ytrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:.9rem;padding:3px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}
.walert{margin:0 0 12px;padding:9px 11px;border-radius:10px;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.5;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.walert b{font-size:1rem}.walert.near,.walert.over{background:#fff;color:#16302b}.walert.over b{color:#b4442a}.walert.near b{color:#9a5b00}.walert small{opacity:.85}
.grtip{position:absolute;z-index:3;min-width:170px;max-width:240px;white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.12);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.5;pointer-events:none}
.nav{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line);min-width:42px;padding:0;font-size:1.2rem}
.cal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}
.dw{text-align:center;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);padding-bottom:2px}.dw.su{color:var(--warn)}.dw.sa{color:var(--accent)}
.cd{min-height:68px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:1px;font-weight:400;font-size:.62rem;line-height:1.25;overflow:hidden}
.cd.su{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warn) 9%,var(--bg))}.cd.sa{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 9%,var(--bg))}.cd.su .n{color:var(--warn)}.cd.sa .n{color:var(--accent)}.cd .hn{font-size:.58rem;color:var(--warn);font-weight:700;line-height:1}
.cd.blank{border:0;background:transparent}.cd .n{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.cd .py{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}.cd.sel{outline:2px solid var(--accent);background:var(--soft)}.cd.today .n{text-decoration:underline}
.er{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.er label{flex:1 1 90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);gap:4px}.ep{font-weight:700;margin-left:auto}
.rv{margin:12px 0}.rv label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.92rem}.rv label:first-child{border-top:0}.rv .p{margin-left:auto;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px"><h1 style="margin-bottom:4px">シフト給与計算</h1><button type="button" class="ghost" id="layoutBtn" style="color:var(--ink)">並べ替え</button></div>
<p class="note" id="syncSt" role="status" style="margin:0 0 14px">この端末に保存しています</p>

<section data-sec="total" data-name="給料のまとめ" class="total">
  <div id="wallAlert"></div>
  <div hidden>
  <div class="head" style="margin-bottom:4px"><span id="sumLbl" style="font-weight:700">今月の見込み給与</span><input type="month" id="month" aria-label="表示する月"></div>
  <div class="big" id="sumPay">¥0</div>
  <div class="sub"><span id="sumDays" hidden></span><span id="sumHours" hidden></span><label style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.8rem;opacity:.9;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="showRange"> 勤務期間を表示</label></div>
  </div>
  <div id="byJob" hidden></div>
  <div id="inMonth"></div>
  <div class="byjob" id="payBox"></div>
</section>

<section data-sec="cur" data-name="入力するバイト先">
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px">入力するバイト先</h2>
  <div class="chips" id="curBar" style="margin:0"></div>
  <p style="margin:10px 0 0"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="goSet" style="color:var(--ink)">バイト先の設定を開く</button></p>
  <p class="note" style="margin:4px 0 0">シフトを追加するときの登録先です。カレンダーはバイト先ごとの色で表示されます。</p>
</section>

<section data-sec="cal" data-name="カレンダー">
  <div class="head"><button type="button" class="nav" id="prevM" aria-label="前の月">‹</button><h2 id="calTitle" style="margin:0"></h2><button type="button" class="nav" id="nextM" aria-label="次の月">›</button></div>
  <div id="calWarn"></div>
  <div class="cal" id="cal"></div>
  <p class="note">日付をタップすると、その日のシフトを追加・編集できます。土曜は青緑、日曜と祝日（祝）は赤で表示します。祝日は振替休日・国民の休日も含めて自動で計算しています。塾の講習は、斜線の帯と「講」の文字で通常授業と区別されます。</p>
</section>

<section id="dayEd" hidden></section>

<section data-sec="req" data-name="シフト希望（仮のシフト）">
  <h2>シフト希望（仮のシフト）</h2>
  <div class="row">
    <label>送り先<select id="rqJob"></select></label>
    <label>月<input type="month" id="rqMonth"></label>
  </div>
<div class="fold" data-fold="req-cal"><button type="button" class="fold-h" data-fold-t="req-cal"><span>仮のシフトを作る</span><span class="sm" id="rqSm1"></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▼</span></button><div class="fold-b">
  <p class="note" style="margin:6px 0 8px">日付をタップして、出勤できる時間を入れます。入れた分は自分だけの「仮のシフト」として、上のカレンダーにも点線で出ます（給料には入りません）。色の点は、ほかのバイト先のシフトがある日です。</p>
  <div class="cal" id="rqCal"></div>
  <div id="rqEd"></div>
  <p class="note" id="rqCount" style="margin:6px 0 0"></p>
  <p style="margin:8px 0 0;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="rqOthers" style="color:var(--ink)">ほかのバイトがある日を休みにする</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="rqClear">この月の仮のシフトを消す</button></p>
</div></div>
<div class="fold" data-fold="req-text"><button type="button" class="fold-h" data-fold-t="req-text"><span>送る文章・本番への登録</span><span class="sm" id="rqSm2"></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▼</span></button><div class="fold-b">
  <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
    <label>伝え方<select id="rqFmt"><option value="ok">出勤できる日と時間を伝える</option><option value="off">休み希望を伝える</option><option value="both">両方を伝える</option></select></label>
  </div>
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);gap:4px;margin-top:10px">ひとこと（任意）<textarea id="rqMsg" rows="2" placeholder="例: テスト期間の17日〜21日は入れません" style="font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px"></textarea></label>
  <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);gap:4px;margin-top:10px">送る文章<textarea id="rqText" rows="8" readonly style="font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px"></textarea></label>
  <p style="margin:10px 0 0;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button type="button" id="rqCopy">文章をコピー</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="rqCommit" style="color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)">シフトが決まったら：仮のシフトを本番に登録</button></p>
</div></div>
  <p class="note" id="rqNote" role="status"></p>
</section>

<section data-sec="graph" data-name="月別グラフ">
  <h2>月別グラフ</h2>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">
    <select id="grYear" aria-label="年" style="width:auto"></select>
    <div class="chips" id="grMetric" style="margin:0"><button type="button" class="chip cj" data-gm="pay" style="--c:var(--accent)">給料</button><button type="button" class="chip cj" data-gm="work" style="--c:var(--accent)">勤務時間</button></div>
    <div class="chips" id="grBasis" style="margin:0"><button type="button" class="chip cj" data-gb="pay" style="--c:var(--accent)">給料日の月</button><button type="button" class="chip cj" data-gb="work" style="--c:var(--accent)">働いた月</button></div>
  </div>
<div class="fold" data-fold="graph-chart"><button type="button" class="fold-h" data-fold-t="graph-chart"><span>グラフ</span><span class="sm" id="grSm"></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▼</span></button><div class="fold-b">
  <div id="grChart" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
  <div id="grLegend" style="font-size:.82rem;margin-top:6px"></div>
  <p class="note" id="grNote" style="margin:4px 0 0"></p>
</div></div>
  <details style="margin-top:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700">表で見る</summary><div id="grTable" style="margin-top:6px;overflow-x:auto"></div></details>
</section>

<section data-sec="cmp" data-name="実際の支給額と比べる" id="cmpSec">
  <h2>実際の支給額と比べる</h2>
  <div class="row">
    <label>バイト先<select id="cJob"></select></label>
    <label>給料日<select id="cPer"></select></label>
    <label>実際の総支給額（円）<input type="number" id="cAmt" min="0" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="給与明細の総支給額"></label>
  </div>
  <p class="note" style="margin:6px 0 0">税金や保険を引く前の「総支給額」を入れてください。差額と、考えられる原因・直し方を出します。</p>
  <div id="cOut"></div>
</section>

<section data-sec="fuyo" data-name="扶養の計算" id="fySec">
  <h2>扶養の計算</h2>
  <div class="row">
    <label>年<select id="fyYear"></select></label>
    <label>守りたい壁<select id="fyTarget"></select></label>
    <label>その年の12/31の年齢<select id="fyAge"><option value="19-22">19〜22歳（大学生など）</option><option value="other">それ以外</option></select></label>
  </div>
  <div class="fold" data-fold="fy-slip"><button type="button" class="fold-h" data-fold-t="fy-slip"><span>給与明細の写真から入れる</span><span class="sm" id="slSm"></span><span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▼</span></button><div class="fold-b">
    <p class="note" id="slOff" style="margin:4px 0 0">この画面では写真の読み取りが使えません。下の一覧に手で入れてください。</p>
    <div id="slBox" hidden>
      <p class="note" style="margin:4px 0 6px">給与明細を撮って追加すると、総支給額・交通費・支給日を読み取り、合う給料日に入れます。何枚でも追加できます。</p>
      <div class="row"><label>どのバイト先の明細か<select id="slJob"></select></label></div>
      <input type="file" id="slFile" accept="image/*" multiple hidden>
      <div class="chips" id="slList" style="margin:8px 0 0"></div>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="slPick" style="color:var(--ink)">明細の写真を追加</button><button type="button" id="slGo" hidden>読み取る</button></p>
      <p class="note" id="slMsg" role="status"></p>
      <div class="rv" id="slReview"></div>
      <button type="button" id="slReg" hidden>選んだ明細を入れる</button>
    </div>
